  "primary_finding_basis": "This is an association study of genotype/phenotype data from12cohorts,7070ADcases/8169controls. It combines cohort-specific estimates but reports a new PICALM-by-APOE interaction from logistic-regression models fitted within those data, not merely a literature-review assertion. Current primary specifically tests that published interaction OR0.84,p.0068 against its ownOR0.97,p.74. No underlying earlier interaction paper is substituted from title or bibliography alone.",
